|--------------|--------|
| Skills, files, analyze/tests, splits, dead non-save code | Weaken hard locks in `product-locks` |
| New zone / class / God Hand direction / scaled UA / IAP convenience within cheap-SHOP lock | Invent a second combat sim; gacha / BiS-for-cash |
| Commit, push, PR, tag when green | Force-push; skip hooks; point players at GitHub Releases; **upload Play AAB without owner ask** |
| A56 look / hub smoke; listing docs; wipe test save if needed; Console paste | |

Ambiguous “two different games” (meny vs combat): silent
